  },
  {
   "id": "ManageFeedsScreen",
   "change": "rename",
   "title": "Shows",
   "group": "Shows",
   "note": "Becomes the Shows tab: followed shows sorted by newest episode, each row with 'N new', the newest episode's title and a play button. Quiet shows in a collapsed group at the bottom (two rows, then Show all). Toolbar + opens the Add sheet, which carries Paste, Browse and Import from another app. The tab only lists and plays; Quiet and Unfollow live on the Show screen, so no landing tab manages a feed."
  },
  {
